# Best questions to ask your AI assistant

# Recommended first question

Campaign performance
Which campaign should we double down on, and why? Compare engagement rate, reach, impressions, and conversions where available. Support your recommendation with actual data.


Content strategy
Which content format performs best for SUGAR Cosmetics, and what should we publish more often?


Engagement optimization
What are the three biggest opportunities to improve Instagram engagement, based on the currently filtered data?


Posting strategy
Which days and times appear most effective for posting, and how confident can we be based on the available data?


Executive summary
Summarize Instagram performance for management. Highlight key KPIs, best-performing campaigns, weaknesses, and the top three recommended actions.
